# Spring Boot looks up failure analyzers here, before there is an application context, so
# LuceneIndexVersionFailureAnalyzer cannot be a @Component. It turns the Lucene index version
# guard's refusal to start into a printed upgrade instruction instead of a stack trace - see
# LuceneIndexVersionCheck and docs/md/installation/lucene-reindex.md.
org.springframework.boot.diagnostics.FailureAnalyzer=\
com.epam.catgenome.app.LuceneIndexVersionFailureAnalyzer
